{"id":818,"date":"2025-08-21T12:05:54","date_gmt":"2025-08-21T12:05:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/bombayfoodstuff\/?post_type=product&#038;p=818"},"modified":"2025-08-26T08:26:30","modified_gmt":"2025-08-26T08:26:30","slug":"nutmeg","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/product\/nutmeg\/","title":{"rendered":"Nutmeg (Jaiphal)"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2><b>Nutmeg (Jaiphal) \u2013 Bombay Foodstuff<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><b>Hindi Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Jaiphal<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Botanical Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Myristica fragrans Houtt.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Family Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Myristicaceae<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Commercial Part:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Seed (Nutmeg) and Aril (Mace)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nutmeg from <\/span><b>Bombay Foodstuff<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a premium spice sourced from trusted farms and processed with utmost care to retain its natural aroma and flavor. The nutmeg seed is encased within the fruit of the <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Myristica fragrans<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> tree, with its outer red aril yielding mace and the inner kernel yielding nutmeg.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Known for its <\/span><b>warm, sweet, and aromatic taste<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, nutmeg is a favorite in both sweet and savory dishes. It enriches pies, custards, puddings, cookies, cheese sauces, souffl\u00e9s, and festive drinks. Its delicate profile also complements curries, soups, and meat preparations.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nutmeg isn\u2019t just about taste\u2014it offers <\/span><b>digestive and therapeutic benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> too. In small amounts, it aids digestion, improves appetite, reduces flatulence, and helps relieve nausea and diarrhea.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At <\/span><b>Bombay Foodstuff<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we deliver <\/span><b>export-quality nutmeg<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in whole and ground form, ensuring unmatched freshness, purity, and consistency for food manufacturers, spice traders, and bulk buyers worldwide.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Premium-quality whole nutmeg sourced from trusted growers, delivering rich aroma and warm, slightly sweet flavor. Ideal for culinary, bakery, beverage, and spice blends, this versatile spice enhances taste and fragrance in food products. Available in bulk packaging, Bombay Foodstuff ensures consistent quality, purity, and timely supply for B2B partners across food processing, catering, and retail industries.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1055,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[25],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-818","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-uncategorized","first","instock","shipping-taxable","product-type-simple"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/818","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/product"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=818"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1055"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=818"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"product_brand","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_brand?post=818"},{"taxonomy